---
name: status
description: Current state of the GPS reporting pipeline as of 2026-03-16
type: project
---

Pipeline is fully working end-to-end as of 2026-03-16.

**Why:** Baylor Football automated post-practice GPS report using Catapult Connect v6 API, DuckDB local storage, self-contained HTML + plain-text email.

**How to apply:** No major infrastructure work needed. Focus on report improvements, new metrics, or usability.

DB contains 130 sessions (100 backfilled with full metric set):
- Spring 2025: P1–P15 + 13 Walk-Thrus (2025-03-22 to 2025-04-26)
- Fall Camp 2025: P1–P18 + 17 Walk-Thrus (2025-07-30 to 2025-08-20)
- Regular Season 2025: 54 practices + 12 games (Auburn through Houston)
- Spring 2026: 1 session (SP26 - 4TH QTR #4 - 2026-03-06); more being added now

Last confirmed working run: 2026-03-16 generated report for 2026-03-06 session.
Spring 2026 practices are ongoing (today is 2026-03-28).

Sessions table does NOT have a `session_type` column in the schema — type is inferred from session name pattern.
